                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game itself may be good, but there have been players on the map for years who own 30 fully upgraded cities.\nAll it takes is a single player who has it out for you or simply sees you as a “farm” to ruin the whole game for you.\nYou don’t stand a chance to build up your base. it’s real time online PvP.\nUnfortunately, it’s also a “p2w” game you can buy ingame currency with real money and purchase all kinds of bonuses,\nsuch as 10% more damage, 25% more resources, instant completions, and so on.\n\nAnd yeah, I know my way around games like this. I used to play Travian before it got so bad and became even more paytowin.",
